<title>HUNGARY: RESEARCH ALERT-NYBB rates Primagaz 'buy'.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-NYBB rates Primagaz 'buy'.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungarian securities house New York Broker Budapest (NYBB) started coverage of Hungarian gas distribution company Primagaz Rt with a 'buy' recommendation assigned on technical grounds.</p>
<p>&quot;In the chart the price touched a very strong support level on July 11,&quot; said analyst Gabriella Bor in a research note dated July 15. &quot;On that day a series of falling closing prices ended.&quot;</p>
<p>Primagaz's price should first break 10,530 forints as this was the upper line of a downward channel, Bor said, adding &quot;this would form the basis of the price rise&quot;.</p>
<p>On Wednesday Primagaz shares opened 10,400 forints, up 75 from Tuesday's close.</p>
<p>-- Emese Bartha, Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
